PROJECT: SMARTDESK AI

AI-Powered Customer Support Ticket Management System

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, AI engineer, database architect, and UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, functional, modern, full-stack web application named SmartDesk AI, an AI-powered customer support ticket management platform.

The application must help organizations manage incoming customer support requests by automatically classifying tickets, estimating urgency, recommending solutions, summarizing conversations, assigning tickets to agents, and analyzing support performance.

This is a real software project, not just a frontend prototype. Implement the frontend, backend, database integration, AI integration, validation, error handling, and documentation.

Do not generate only a landing page or static dashboard. Every major feature must work.

If a feature requires an API key or external service, implement the integration properly and provide clear configuration instructions. Never pretend that an operation succeeded if it has not actually executed.

